        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy LTX-2 Text to Video\n\nGenerate high-quality videos from text prompts with synchronized audio-video generation using LTX-2. Features expressive lip sync, dynamic motion generation, and efficient performance. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/video_ltx2_t2v.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
